        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: சுளுக்கு",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சுளுக்கு — cuḷukku — \"a sprain\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "விளையாடும்போது எனக்குக் காலில் சுளுக்கு ஏற்பட்டது. viḷaiyāṭumpōtu eṉakkuk kālil cuḷukku ēṟpaṭṭatu. I sprained my foot while playing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a verb: கால் சுளுக்கியது, the foot got sprained."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "சுளுக்கு (cuḷukku) is native Dravidian (DEDR 2702); the entry also has உளுக்கு uḷukku for the same."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for describing what you lived and felt."
            }
          ]
        },
